  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Khaloom designs and produces hand-woven textiles from recycled yarns.With a DGGF Start-up Loan Khaloom will be able to set up a new production site near Bangalore and scale up their operational activities to a commercially workable level.Since 2017, Khaloom received DGGF Technical Assistance to execute technical and commercial validation and therewith prepared present investment.</narrative>
